{
  "actions": {
    "DescribeInstances": {
      "document": "本接口 (DescribeInstances) 用于查询一个或多个实例的详细信息。\n\n- 可以根据实例ID、vpcid或者实例私有IP等信息来查询实例的详细信息。过滤信息详细请见过滤器Filter。\n- 如果参数为空，返回当前用户一定数量（Limit所指定的数量，默认为20）的实例。",
      "input": "DescribeInstancesRequest",
      "name": "查看实例列表",
      "output": "DescribeInstancesResponse",
      "status": "online"
    },
    "RunProxyCall": {
      "document": "cube通过云api提供一个“公司内部”的通用代理接口，实现在公有云vpc环境实现网络访问。",
      "input": "RunProxyCallRequest",
      "name": "通用代理访问云支撑环境接口",
      "output": "RunProxyCallResponse",
      "status": "online"
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "apiVersion": "2024-03-04",
    "api_brief": "管理Cube安全容器的整个生命周期",
    "serviceNameCN": "高性能弹性计算底座",
    "serviceShortName": "cube"
  },
  "objects": {
    "DataDisk": {
      "document": "描述了数据盘的信息",
      "members": [
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "磁盘大小，单位GB。\n注意：此字段可能返回 null，表示取不到有效值。",
          "example": "50",
          "member": "int64",
          "name": "DiskSize",
          "output_required": false,
          "required": true,
          "type": "int",
          "value_allowed_null": true
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "数据盘ID。LOCAL_BASIC 和 LOCAL_SSD 类型没有ID，暂时不支持该参数。\n该参数目前仅用于DescribeInstances等查询类接口的返回参数，不可用于RunInstances等写接口的入参。\n注意：此字段可能返回 null，表示取不到有效值。",
          "example": "\"disk-lzrg2pwi\"",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "DiskId",
          "output_required": false,
          "required": true,
          "type": "string",
          "value_allowed_null": true
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "硬盘介质类型。取值范围：\n\n- CLOUD_BASIC：表示普通云硬盘\n- CLOUD_PREMIUM：表示高性能云硬盘\n- CLOUD_BSSD：表示通用型SSD云硬盘\n- CLOUD_SSD：表示SSD云硬盘\n- CLOUD_HSSD：表示增强型SSD云硬盘\n- CLOUD_TSSD：表示极速型SSD云硬盘。\n注意：此字段可能返回 null，表示取不到有效值。",
          "example": "CLOUD_HSSD",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "DiskType",
          "output_required": false,
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "value_allowed_null": true
        }
      ],
      "usage": "both"
    },
    "DescribeInstancesRequest": {
      "document": "DescribeInstances请求参数结构体",
      "members": [
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "描述键值对过滤器，用于条件过滤查询。例如过滤ID、名称、状态等\n\n- 若存在多个Filter时，Filter间的关系为逻辑与（AND）关系。\n- 若同一个Filter存在多个Values，同一Filter下Values间的关系为逻辑或（OR）关系。",
          "example": "无",
          "member": "FilterItem",
          "name": "Filters",
          "required": false,
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "偏移量，默认为0。关于Offset的更进一步介绍请参考 API 简介中的相关小节",
          "example": "1",
          "member": "int64",
          "name": "Offset",
          "required": false,
          "type": "int"
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "返回数量，默认为20，最大值为100。关于Limit的更进一步介绍请参考 API 简介中的相关小节",
          "example": "20",
          "member": "int64",
          "name": "Limit",
          "required": false,
          "type": "int"
        }
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DescribeInstancesResponse": {
      "document": "DescribeInstances返回参数结构体",
      "members": [
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "实例列表\n注意：此字段可能返回 null，表示取不到有效值。",
          "example": "无",
          "member": "Instance",
          "name": "InstanceSet",
          "output_required": false,
          "type": "list",
          "value_allowed_null": true
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "实例总个数",
          "example": "无",
          "member": "int64",
          "name": "TotalCount",
          "output_required": false,
          "type": "int",
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "document": "唯一请求 ID，由服务端生成，每次请求都会返回（若请求因其他原因未能抵达服务端，则该次请求不会获得 RequestId）。定位问题时需要提供该次请求的 RequestId。",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "RequestId",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "FilterItem": {
      "document": "过滤条件。可以指定的过滤参数为：private-ip-address, instance-id, vpc-id。",
      "members": [
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "需要过滤的字段\n",
          "example": "vpc-id，instance-id，private-ip-address",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "Name",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string"
